---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
import { OPEN_EVO_DIRECT_APPLY_LIVE_DYNAMICS } from '../../data/openEvoDirectApplyLiveDynamics';
import ResearchRouteContext from './ResearchRouteContext.astro';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);
const currentGatedDeltaHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/gated-delta-sd-lora/');
const q17DiagnosticsHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/q17-directapply-frontier/');
const directApplyFinalHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/q17-directapply-analysis/');
const directApplyFinal = OPEN_EVO_DIRECT_APPLY_LIVE_DYNAMICS;
const gdr = {
  rounds: 160,
  rollouts: 20480,
  candidates: 44,
  accepted: 7,
  acceptanceRate: '15.9%',
  post49Candidates: 16,
  post49Accepted: 0,
};
---

<article class="gdr-history" data-testid="gdr-directapply-page" data-copy-review data-reader-page="research-explainer">
  <header class="gdr-history__hero" data-reader-context>
    <a class="gdr-history__back" href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/')}>← {t('实验目录', 'Experiment index')}</a>
    <h1>{t('历史 GDR-v1 / DirectApply', 'Historical GDR-v1 / DirectApply')}</h1>
    <p class="gdr-history__lede" data-reader-task data-reader-purpose>{t(
      '这次历史实验不是 recurrent Gated Delta Rule。SD-LoRA candidate 会先完整训练出来；本地 GDR-v1 再用固定 16 道题做一次短期检查，决定采用新状态还是继续旧状态。160 轮里一共训练出 44 个 candidate，最后只有 7 次真正进入后续模型。',
      'This historical experiment was not a recurrent Gated Delta Rule. Each SD-LoRA candidate was trained first; local GDR-v1 then used a fixed 16-task short-horizon check to decide whether to adopt the new state or keep the old one. Across 160 rounds it trained 44 candidates, but only seven entered later model states.'
    )}</p>
    <a class="gdr-history__current" href={currentGatedDeltaHref}>{t('查看现在真正研究的 Gated-Delta SD-LoRA →', 'Open the current Gated-Delta SD-LoRA derivation →')}</a>
  </header>
  <ResearchRouteContext locale={locale} route="gdr-directapply" experimentId="gdr-v1-1p7b" compact />
  <section class="gdr-history__section" id="admission-rule" aria-labelledby="admission-rule-title">
    <h2 id="admission-rule-title">{t('旧 GDR-v1 做的是 candidate admission', 'Local GDR-v1 was candidate admission')}</h2>
    <div class="gdr-history__compare">
      <figure>
        <figcaption><strong>GDR-v1</strong><span>{t('candidate 训练完以后再筛一次', 'screen again after candidate training')}</span></figcaption>
        <ol>
          <li><b>1</b><span>{t('完成一轮 WebShop rollout', 'complete one WebShop rollout round')}</span></li>
          <li><b>2</b><span>{t('训练 SD-LoRA candidate', 'train an SD-LoRA candidate')}</span></li>
          <li><b>3</b><span>{t('固定 16 题 probe 比较新旧状态', 'compare new and old states on a fixed 16-task probe')}</span></li>
          <li><b>4</b><span>{t('通过才采用；否则 KEEP PRIOR', 'adopt only if it passes; otherwise KEEP PRIOR')}</span></li>
        </ol>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <figcaption><strong>DirectApply</strong><span>{t('移除 task-score veto', 'remove the task-score veto')}</span></figcaption>
        <ol>
          <li><b>1</b><span>{t('完成相同预算的 WebShop rollout', 'complete the matched WebShop rollout budget')}</span></li>
          <li><b>2</b><span>{t('训练同类 SD-LoRA candidate', 'train the same kind of SD-LoRA candidate')}</span></li>
          <li><b>3</b><span>{t('工程 / 数据合同继续 fail-closed', 'engineering / data contracts remain fail-closed')}</span></li>
          <li><b>4</b><span>{t('通过合同后直接进入下一状态', 'enter the next state directly after those contracts pass')}</span></li>
        </ol>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gdr-history__section" id="what-happened" aria-labelledby="what-happened-title">
    <h2 id="what-happened-title">{t('历史 GDR-v1 训练了 44 个 candidate，只采用了 7 个', 'Historical GDR-v1 trained 44 candidates and adopted seven')}</h2>
    <dl class="gdr-history__metrics">
      <div><dt>{t('训练轮数', 'Rounds')}</dt><dd>{gdr.rounds}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('WebShop 尝试', 'WebShop attempts')}</dt><dd>{gdr.rollouts.toLocaleString('en-US')}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>SD-LoRA candidates</dt><dd>{gdr.candidates}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('正式进入后续模型', 'Adopted updates')}</dt><dd>{gdr.accepted}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('采用比例', 'Admission rate')}</dt><dd>{gdr.acceptanceRate}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('R49 之后', 'After R49')}</dt><dd>{gdr.post49Candidates} candidates → {gdr.post49Accepted} adopted</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p>{t('R49 时累计已经有 28 个 candidate、7 次采用；之后又训练出 16 个 candidate，但采用次数没有再增加。这个事实说明旧 GDR-v1 的第二次筛选对长期学习轨迹影响很强，但它本身不能告诉我们被拒绝的 candidate 最终会不会变好。', 'By R49 there were already 28 candidates and seven admissions. Sixteen more candidates were trained afterward, but the admission count never increased. This shows that the second-stage screen strongly constrained the long-run learning path, but it cannot tell us whether rejected candidates would later have become useful.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="gdr-history__section" id="directapply-result" aria-labelledby="directapply-result-title">
    <h2 id="directapply-result-title">{t('DirectApply 让 candidate 继续学习，但不能和旧 GDR final 直接相减', 'DirectApply let candidates continue, but its final cannot be subtracted from the historical GDR final')}</h2>
    <p>{t(`DirectApply 后来跑完 ${directApplyFinal.sealedRounds} 轮、${directApplyFinal.formalRollouts.toLocaleString('en-US')} 次 WebShop 尝试，159 次 SD-LoRA candidate 都进入后续状态。训练结束后只打开一次冻结 128 题 final：Task Score ${directApplyFinal.finalScore.toFixed(2)} / 100，完整成功 ${directApplyFinal.finalExactSuccessCount} / ${directApplyFinal.finalValidCount}。`, `DirectApply later completed ${directApplyFinal.sealedRounds} rounds and ${directApplyFinal.formalRollouts.toLocaleString('en-US')} WebShop attempts, with all 159 SD-LoRA candidates entering later states. After training it opened one frozen 128-task final: Task Score ${directApplyFinal.finalScore.toFixed(2)} / 100 with ${directApplyFinal.finalExactSuccessCount} / ${directApplyFinal.finalValidCount} exact successes.`)}</p>
    <p class="gdr-history__boundary">{t('历史 GDR final 与 DirectApply final 不是同一个冻结题集，因此旧 GDR 的 37.60 和 DirectApply 的 60.72 不能直接当成 gate 的因果效果。', 'The historical GDR final and the DirectApply final used different frozen panels, so historical GDR 37.60 versus DirectApply 60.72 is not a causal effect of the gate.')}</p>
    <p class="gdr-history__links"><a href={directApplyFinalHref}>{t('查看 DirectApply 完整 R0–R159 曲线与 final →', 'Open the complete DirectApply R0–R159 trajectory and final →')}</a></p>
  </section>
  <section class="gdr-history__section" id="diagnostic" aria-labelledby="diagnostic-title">
    <h2 id="diagnostic-title">{t('同一批题复测说明：单轮大跌不等于同幅度整体遗忘', 'A same-task check showed that a large live-round drop is not the same as equal global forgetting')}</h2>
    <p>{t('DirectApply 的 R127→R128 在不同训练题上看起来约 76.1→48.9；把两个 checkpoint 放到同一批 32 题上以后，是 63.58→59.41，完整成功 10 题→8 题。抽题差异解释了很大一部分表面波动，同时参数更新确实重新分配了少数任务的成败。', 'R127→R128 looked like roughly 76.1→48.9 on different training-task samples. On the same 32 tasks, the two checkpoints measured 63.58→59.41 with exact successes moving from 10 to 8. Task sampling explains much of the apparent swing, while the parameter update still reallocates success on a small number of tasks.')}</p>
    <p class="gdr-history__boundary">{t('这项诊断只解释 DirectApply 内部一次 checkpoint 变化，不证明旧 GDR-v1 的 veto 一定错误，也不决定两种方法的最终胜负。', 'This diagnostic explains one checkpoint transition inside DirectApply. It does not prove that the historical GDR-v1 veto was always wrong, and it does not decide the final method comparison.')}</p>
    <p class="gdr-history__links"><a href={q17DiagnosticsHref}>{t('查看 R127 / R128 固定同题诊断 →', 'Open the R127 / R128 same-task diagnostic →')}</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="gdr-history__section" id="why-new-mechanism" aria-labelledby="why-new-mechanism-title">
    <h2 id="why-new-mechanism-title">{t('这项旧实验留下的是一个机制问题', 'The old experiment left a mechanism question')}</h2>
    <p>{t('本地 GDR-v1 回答的是“已经训练好的 candidate 要不要放行”，不是“参数 State 应该怎样连续更新”。因此旧实验保留原样；新的 Gated-Delta SD-LoRA 研究另开一页，从 recurrent State update 本身重新推导。', 'Local GDR-v1 answered whether an already-trained candidate should be admitted, not how parameter State should be updated continuously. The old experiment therefore stays intact, while the new Gated-Delta SD-LoRA work gets its own page and re-derives the recurrent State update itself.')}</p>
    <a class="gdr-history__current gdr-history__current--end" href={currentGatedDeltaHref}>{t('进入当前 Gated-Delta SD-LoRA 推导 →', 'Open the current Gated-Delta SD-LoRA derivation →')}</a>
  </section>

  <details class="gdr-history__evidence">
    <summary>{t('技术证据：历史运行的关键对齐与边界', 'Technical evidence: key historical alignment and boundaries')}</summary>
    <dl>
      <div><dt>GDR-v1</dt><dd><code>160 rounds · 20,480 rollouts · 44 candidates · 7 adopted</code></dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('R49 之后', 'After R49')}</dt><dd><code>16 candidates · 0 adopted</code></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Round 0</dt><dd>{t('DirectApply 与 GDR-v1 的 128 个 rollout case 在 task / seed / completion / action / reward / invalid 上逐一语义匹配；adapter bytes 不是 bitwise-identical。', 'DirectApply and GDR-v1 matched semantically case-by-case across all 128 Round-0 rollouts for task / seed / completion / action / reward / invalid; adapter bytes were not bitwise-identical.')}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('比较边界', 'Comparison boundary')}</dt><dd>{t('两条线没有同一个 frozen final panel，因此没有最终 paired method effect。', 'The two lines do not share one frozen final panel, so there is no final paired method effect.')}</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </details>
</article>
<style>
.gdr-history{width:min(980px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:0 auto;padding:2.3rem 0 5rem;color:var(--text)}
.gdr-history__hero{padding:1rem 0 2.2rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.gdr-history__back,.gdr-history__current,.gdr-history__links a{color:var(--accent-deep);font-weight:750;text-underline-offset:.2em}
.gdr-history__hero h1{margin:.9rem 0 .8rem;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.6rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.04em}
.gdr-history__lede{max-width:52rem;margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2.4vw,1.55rem);line-height:1.65}
.gdr-history__current{display:inline-flex;margin-top:1rem}.gdr-history__current--end{margin-top:.5rem}
.gdr-history__section{padding:2.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.gdr-history__section h2{max-width:46rem;margin:0 0 .8rem;font-size:clamp(1.75rem,3.8vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.gdr-history__section>p{max-width:50rem;margin:.75rem 0;font-size:1.06rem;line-height:1.72}
.gdr-history__boundary{padding-left:1rem;border-left:3px solid var(--accent-deep);font-weight:650}
.gdr-history__compare{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem;margin-top:1.4rem}
.gdr-history__compare figure{margin:0;padding:1rem;border-top:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface-muted)}
.gdr-history__compare figcaption{display:grid;gap:.18rem;margin-bottom:.8rem}.gdr-history__compare figcaption strong{font-size:1.1rem}.gdr-history__compare figcaption span{color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem}
.gdr-history__compare ol{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.gdr-history__compare li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2rem 1fr;gap:.55rem;padding:.55rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.gdr-history__compare li b{font:800 .9rem/1.4 var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent-deep)}.gdr-history__compare li span{line-height:1.5}
.gdr-history__metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:0;margin:1.2rem 0 1rem;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
.gdr-history__metrics>div{padding:.85rem 1rem;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.gdr-history__metrics>div:nth-child(3n){border-right:0}.gdr-history__metrics dt{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}.gdr-history__metrics dd{margin:.2rem 0 0;font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:800}
.gdr-history__evidence{margin-top:2rem;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.gdr-history__evidence summary{padding:1rem 0;cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent-deep);font-weight:750}.gdr-history__evidence dl{margin:0 0 1rem}.gdr-history__evidence dl>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:10rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:.6rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.gdr-history__evidence dt{font-weight:800}.gdr-history__evidence dd{margin:0;line-height:1.55}.gdr-history code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
@media(max-width:760px){.gdr-history{width:min(100% - 1rem,980px);padding-top:1.2rem}.gdr-history__compare,.gdr-history__metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr}.gdr-history__metrics>div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.gdr-history__metrics>div:last-child{border-bottom:0}.gdr-history__evidence dl>div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.2rem}}
</style>
